%%{init: {"theme": "neutral"} }%%
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor M as Merchant
    participant B as Browser (mp)
    participant P as apps/mp (server actions)
    participant A as Tally apps/api
    participant D as Postgres (tally)
    participant Q as Qore Catalog
    participant R as Cloudflare R2

    M->>B: open /stocktake/history?business=<id>
    B->>P: page request
    P->>A: GET /api/businesses/:id/vision/stocktakes?limit= [Bearer JWT]
    A->>D: mark stale runs failed, then runs + quick scans newest first, line counts by action
    A-->>P: [{kind, status, lines, decided, …}]
    P-->>B: history grouped by day
    M->>B: open an entry → /stocktake/<runId> or /stocktake/scan/<scanId>
    P->>A: GET …/stocktakes/:runId or GET …/shelf-scans/:scanId
    A->>D: scan + detections (review, match, decisions) + items they refer to
    par fill the stored scan back in
        A->>Q: GET /v1/products/:qid per candidate [cached 10 min, best-effort]
    and
        A->>R: presign tally/crops/<scanId>/<position>.webp [1 h]
    end
    A-->>P: scan view: status, candidates with names and prices, cropUrl, decision per line
    P-->>B: running → poll · open → review table · confirmed → read-only · failed → reason
    B->>B: shelf photo from IndexedDB, when this browser took it
    B->>R: line crops via cropUrl (when there is no photo)
